Source: Department of State, Central Files, 770.00/4-2861. Confidential;
                    Priority. Drafted by Herz on April 27; cleared by Ferguson, Deming, Weiss, McBride, Spiers, Witman, Burdett, Penfield, and Webb; and approved by Williams. Also sent to Paris and repeated to
                    Abidjan, Lagos, and Monrovia.
